{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49429","headline":"临江仙 五 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素洛春光潋灩平，千重媚脸初生。\n凌波罗韈势轻轻。\n烟笼日照，珠翠半分明。\n风引宝衣疑欲舞，鸾回凤翥堪惊。\n也知心许恐无成。\n陈王辞赋，千载有声名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}